<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal inflation rose 0.3 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Portugal inflation rose 0.3 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese consumer prices rose 0.3 percent in January after 0.1 percent in December to give year-on-year inflation of 3.3 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>Average annual inflation, the government's yardstick, was 3.2 percent in January after 3.1 percent in December.</p>
<p> PORTUGUESE INFLATION	  Jan 97	 Dec 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI rise		  0.3	  0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation		3.3	  3.3</p>
<p> Average annual inflation	3.2	  3.1</p>
</text>
